1. Wheel Defect & Crack Detection
Dataset 1: Railway Wheel Defect Dataset 
📎 https://www.kaggle.com/search?q=railway+wheel+defect
Details:
	• Wheel images (good vs defective)
	• Includes: 
		○ cracks
		○ flats
		○ wear
 Dataset 2: Surface Crack Detection Dataset (General – Transfer Learning)
📎 https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/arunrk7/surface-crack-detection
Details:
	• Concrete/metal crack images
	• 40,000+ images

